#
# For a description of the syntax of this configuration file,
# see the file kconfig-language.txt in the NuttX tools repository.
#

config SYSTEM_MONO
	bool "Mono .NET runtime"
	default n
	depends on SYSTEM_HCOM && BUILD_PROTECTED && CRYPTO_MBEDTLS
	---help---
		Link the Mono .NET runtime into the user image, with the host code
		that starts it (meadow_mono_main, run by hcom as the "Mono" task)
		and the P/Invoke tables that connect managed code to System.Native,
		the TLS shim and the Meadow APIs.

		The runtime archives are built by build-mono.sh from the runtime
		checkout given by MEADOW_RUNTIME_DIR (default ../runtime beside
		the repository) and are linked into the SDRAM runtime image.
